"""Phase 1 — minimum-viable Bazel scaffold for cocos4-rust.

This module is intentionally tiny. Phase 2 will register `rules_rust`
and add a `rust_library` target per Cargo crate. Until then, Bazel
only knows how to build a single `hello` sh_binary — cargo remains
the primary build/test tool.

Per the round-55 → Phase 0 deep research synthesis (2026-06-08):
- Pin Bazel 7.x via .bazelversion (Bazelisk auto-downloads)
- Use bzlmod (the Bazel 7+ default) — no WORKSPACE needed
- aspect_rules_js v1.36.0 is the recommended line for the
  AGI-miniGame side (Phase 3); not registered here since
  cocos4-rust is Rust-only
- rules_rust is NOT registered yet — that's Phase 2's job
"""

module(
    name = "cocos4_rust",
    version = "0.1.0",
)

